# CQ-09  Which buildings host a heat pump but no battery?
# Group B (assets and flexibility). Basis: SHIFT-RR-21 shape (recommend storage).
#
# Parameters (method note 5): none. The question is structural -- presence of
# one asset class and absence of another. No rule threshold applies.
#
# NOTE this returns nothing on the aran graph. shift:BuildingAsset and
# shift:connectedToBuilding both exist in the TBox, but the v0.1.1 generator
# instantiates no buildings and asserts no connectedToBuilding triples, so the
# gold answer is empty too. Recorded as vacuous, not as a pass. The gap is in
# the ABox, not the vocabulary.
PREFIX shift: <https://w3id.org/shift/core#>
PREFIX xsd:   <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>
SELECT ?building
WHERE {
  ?building a shift:BuildingAsset .
  ?heatPump a shift:HeatPumpAsset ;
            shift:connectedToBuilding ?building .
  FILTER NOT EXISTS {
    ?battery a shift:BatteryAsset ;
             shift:connectedToBuilding ?building .
  }
}
ORDER BY ?building
